      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Puzzle Grid</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Puzzle</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Swap adjacent tiles to make each row a single color.</p>\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <span>Swaps: <span id=\"swapCount\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</span></span>\n      <span id=\"solvedMessage\" hidden>Solved!</span>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"board\" class=\"board\" role=\"grid\" aria-label=\"4 by 4 puzzle grid\"></div>\n    <button id=\"shuffleBtn\" class=\"btn\">Shuffle</button>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with game card, board, swap counter, solved message, and shuffle button."
