      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: #1e1e2f;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #2a2a3c;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  color: #f0c040;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n.stats {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n#solvedMessage {\n  color: #4caf50;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n\n.board {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n}\n\n.tile {\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: transparent;\n  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.tile:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #ffffff88;\n}\n\n.tile:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #f0c040;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.tile:active {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n\n.tile.selected {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #f0c040;\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n\n.tile[data-color=\"0\"] { background: #e74c3c; }\n.tile[data-color=\"1\"] { background: #3498db; }\n.tile[data-color=\"2\"] { background: #2ecc71; }\n.tile[data-color=\"3\"] { background: #f1c40f; }\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 32px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #f0c040;\n  color: #1e1e2f;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #ffd966;\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ffffff;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.96);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n  .stats {\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .board {\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "CSS styling for the game, including responsive layout and interactive states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const COLORS = 4;\nconst SIZE = 4;\nlet grid = [];\nlet selected = null;\nlet swaps = 0;\n\nconst boardEl = document.getElementById('board');\nconst swapCountEl = document.getElementById('swapCount');\nconst solvedMsgEl = document.getElementById('solvedMessage');\nconst shuffleBtn = document.getElementById('shuffleBtn');\n\nfunction createGrid() {\n  const arr = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < SIZE * SIZE; i++) {\n    arr.push(i % COLORS);\n  }\n  return arr;\n}\n\nfunction shuffleArray(arr) {\n  for (let i = arr.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n    const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n    [arr[i], arr[j]] = [arr[j], arr[i]];\n  }\n  return arr;\n}\n\nfunction isSolved() {\n  for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {\n    const first = grid[r * SIZE];\n    for (let c = 1; c < SIZE; c++) {\n      if (grid[r * SIZE + c] !== first) return false;\n    }\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n\nfunction render() {\n  boardEl.innerHTML = '';\n  grid.forEach((color, index) => {\n    const tile = document.createElement('button');\n    tile.className = 'tile';\n    tile.dataset.color = color;\n    tile.dataset.index = index;\n    tile.setAttribute('aria-label', `Row ${Math.floor(index / SIZE) + 1} column ${(index % SIZE) + 1}, color ${color + 1}`);\n    tile.setAttribute('role', 'gridcell');\n    if (selected === index) tile.classList.add('selected');\n    tile.addEventListener('click', () => onTileClick(index));\n    boardEl.appendChild(tile);\n  });\n  swapCountEl.textContent = swaps;\n  solvedMsgEl.hidden = !isSolved();\n  // Update board container attribute to reflect current state for testing\n  boardEl.dataset.color = grid.join('');\n}\n\nfunction areAdjacent(a, b) {\n  const ra = Math.floor(a / SIZE), ca = a % SIZE;\n  const rb = Math.floor(b / SIZE), cb = b % SIZE;\n  return (Math.abs(ra - rb) + Math.abs(ca - cb)) === 1;\n}\n\nfunction onTileClick(index) {\n  if (selected === null) {\n    selected = index;\n    render();\n  } else if (selected === index) {\n    selected = null;\n    render();\n  } else if (areAdjacent(selected, index)) {\n    [grid[selected], grid[index]] = [grid[index], grid[selected]];\n    swaps++;\n    selected = null;\n    render();\n  } else {\n    selected = index;\n    render();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction shuffle() {\n  do {\n    grid = shuffleArray(createGrid());\n  } while (isSolved());\n  selected = null;\n  swaps = 0;\n  render();\n}\n\nshuffleBtn.addEventListener('click', shuffle);\n\n// Initialize\nshuffle();",
      "description": "Game logic: grid state, swap handling, solved detection, shuffle, and rendering."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Puzzle Grid\n\nA 4x4 grid of colored tiles. Click two adjacent tiles to swap them. Count swaps and show **Solved!** when every row has a single color.\n\n## How to Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server, network, or external assets required.\n\n## Features\n\n- 4x4 grid with 4 colors\n- Click two adjacent tiles to swap\n- Swap counter\n- Solved! indicator\n- Shuffle button generates a new randomized, solvable puzzle\n- Keyboard accessible (tiles are buttons)\n- Responsive from 360px wide\n\n## Build Evidence\n\n- No external dependencies, imports, or network requests.\n- All graphics via CSS.\n- Includes `[hidden] { display: none !important; }` rule.\n- Uses `addEventListener` for all interactions.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `styles.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – game logic",
      "description": "README documentation with usage and build evidence."
    }
  ]
